---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/components.css';
const schema = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Product", "name": "Luxury Glamping Pods", "description": "Earth-sheltered glamping pods for operators", "brand": {"@type": "Brand", "name": "Revonia"}, "offers": {"@type": "AggregateOffer", "priceCurrency": "GBP", "lowPrice": "45000", "offerCount": 1, "seller": {"@id": "https://luxurymodules.co.uk/#organization"}}, "manufacturer": {"@id": "https://luxurymodules.co.uk/#organization"}, "url": "https://luxurymodules.co.uk/spaces/glamping-pods/", "image": "https://luxurymodules.co.uk/images/og/spaces-glamping-pods.jpg"};
---
<Layout title="Luxury Glamping Pods for Sale UK | Luxury Modules" description="Earth-sheltered glamping pods for sale in the UK, from £45,000 excl. VAT installed. Sizes from 10 to 80m², turnkey with planning, groundworks and fit-out, 8 to 10 week lead time. ROI model and B2B options."  image="/images/og/spaces-glamping-pods.jpg" imageAlt="The Nest at Wildlands: a curved, earth-sheltered guest lodge with a wildflower roof, bifold doors open onto loungers on a gravel terrace" share="Glamping units that book year-round, because earth-sheltered pods are as comfortable in February as in July." schema={schema}>
<div class="pagehero">
  <p class="kicker">Use Case · Commercial</p>
  <h1>Glamping pods that earn their keep</h1>
  <p>Glamping pods guests pay a premium for: earth-sheltered hobbit-style stays that photograph like nothing else on the booking sites, run at near net-zero, and keep earning for decades.</p>
  <div class="price-anchor">From £45,000 per unit</div>
  <div style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn" href="/start-your-project/">Check my site in 2 minutes</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="/book-a-call/" style="margin-left:8px">Book a scoping call</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure" style="margin-left:8px">Brochure</a></div>
  <p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.02em;opacity:.85">Units from £45,000 excl. VAT installed · 8 to 10 weeks with planning in place · 25-year structural warranty</p>
</div>
<div class="strip">Official UK Partner of <b>Revonia</b> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>1,500+</b> projects across Europe &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>25-year</b> structural warranty &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Planning <b>handled for you</b></div>
<div class="imgph hero"><img class="real" src="/images/the-nest-wildlands-.jpg" alt="Luxury glamping pod set into hillside at a holiday park"><span class="lbl">ASSET IN FOLDER → ../The Nest, Wildlands .jpg (temp hero — multi-unit park shot still needed)</span></div>
<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Product</p><h2>The glamping pods guests remember</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead">Every park has timber pods. Nobody else has a hobbit house. An earth-sheltered stay is the listing guests screenshot and send to each other — which is what lets operators charge a nightly rate 2–3&times; a standard pod, with occupancy to match. The photography does the marketing for you.</p>
</div></section>

<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">For Sale</p><h2>Glamping pods for sale: sizes, from-prices and what is included</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:26px">Every unit is sold turnkey: design, planning application, groundworks, craning, installation, services connection, interior fit-out and landscaping, with a 25-year structural warranty. The from-price is the installed price, not the price of a shell on a lorry.</p>
  <div class="tablewrap"><table class="spec">
    <tr><th>Range</th><th>Size</th><th>Typical use on a site</th><th>From (excl. VAT)</th></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="/products/small-living-spaces/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Small Living</a></td><td>10–29m²</td><td>Couples' retreat or studio pod; larger units add a kitchen and bathroom</td><td>£45,000</td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="/products/medium-living-spaces/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Medium Living</a></td><td>30–40m²</td><td>Premium suite or family unit with full kitchen and bathroom</td><td>£99,000</td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="/products/large-living-spaces/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Large Living</a></td><td>60–80m²</td><td>Flagship house for groups, with sauna and spa options</td><td>£199,000</td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="/products/cave-saunas/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Cave Saunas</a></td><td>4.5–23.9m²</td><td>Shared wellness building that lifts the nightly rate across the site</td><td>£30,000</td></tr>
  </table></div>
  <p style="margin-top:18px;max-width:720px">Lead time is 8 to 10 weeks from order to handover where planning is in place. Commercial sites usually need a planning application, which we prepare and manage; allow 6 to 7 months end to end for a first unit, and less for later phases on a consented site. Multi-unit orders are priced per phase at the scoping call. <a href="/start-your-project/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Check your site, planning position and budget in two minutes</a> before you book a call.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="navy-band"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Numbers</p><h2>The numbers</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="tablewrap"><table class="spec">
    <tr><th>Worked example (illustrative)</th><th>Standard timber pod</th><th>Earth-sheltered unit</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Unit cost (turnkey)</td><td>~&pound;35,000</td><td>from &pound;45,000</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Nightly rate</td><td>&pound;95</td><td>&pound;225+</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Occupancy</td><td>55%</td><td>70%+ (novelty draws bookings)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Gross revenue / year</td><td>~&pound;19,000</td><td>~&pound;57,000</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Design life</td><td>15–20 years</td><td>100 years, 25-year warranty</td></tr>
  </table></div>
  <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#8b95ab">Illustrative model — bring your rate card and occupancy and we will run it on your numbers. Full ROI case on the <a href="/commercial/" style="color:var(--gold2)">commercial page</a>.</p>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Operations</p><h2>Built for operators</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="grid cols3">
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Near-zero running costs</h3><p>Earth-sheltering slashes heating — the biggest line in most pods' operating cost.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Minimal maintenance</h3><p>Concrete does not rot, warp or need annual retreatment. Turn it over, book it again.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Multi-unit installs</h3><p>Phased craning across a site; units from the Small to Large Living ranges mixed to your rate card.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Rules</p><h2>Planning for commercial sites</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:26px">Commercial siting is a different planning conversation from a back garden — and we run it for you, application to consent. Background in the <a href="/planning-permission/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">planning guide</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">FAQ</p><h2>Your questions, answered</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the realistic payback period?</h3><p>On premium nightly rates most operators model payback in 3–5 years per unit — then decades of earning life after. We will run the model on your actual rates at the scoping call.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>Can you deliver multiple units in phases?</h3><p>Yes — multi-unit installs are phased around your season so the site keeps trading while it grows.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>Do you sell second-hand or ex-display glamping pods?</h3><p>Not at present. Each unit is cast to order, so there is no ex-display stock; if a showcase or ex-display opportunity arises we tell the people on our list first. Leave your email via the brochure request and you will hear about it.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>What does the glamping pod price include?</h3><p>Design, planning application, groundworks, craning and installation, connection to services, interior fit-out, landscaping over the unit and a 25-year structural warranty. Off-grid packages, furniture and site-wide infrastructure are quoted separately.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>Do you work with sites that have no services?</h3><p>Off-grid packages (solar, battery, water and waste options) are available; site feasibility is confirmed at the site visit.</p></div>
  <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px">More questions? <a href="/faq/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">See the full FAQ</a>.</p>
</div></section><section class="ctaband" id="cta">
  <h2>Run the numbers on your site</h2>
  <p>Book a scoping call with your rate card and site plan — the meeting is the ROI conversation.</p>
  <p style="font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.02em">Units from £45,000 excl. VAT installed · 8 to 10 weeks with planning in place · 25-year structural warranty</p>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/start-your-project/">Check my site in 2 minutes</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/book-a-call/">Book a scoping call</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure">Download the brochure</a></div>
  <p style="font-size:13px;margin-top:18px;color:#8b95ab">Commercial enquiries go straight to a scoping call — the consumer brochure won't answer operator questions. B2B qualifier fields: sector, number of units, site status.</p>
  <!-- BUILD NOTE: brochure CTA = HubSpot email-only form (hidden fields: product_interest, product_range, audience_type, source_page_url). Scoping CTA -> contact.html until /book-a-call/ with calendar embed exists. -->
</section>
</Layout>
